{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/Join_Discord.jpg?t=1745227122\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/Steam_Intro.gif?t=1745227122\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter a world of tactical mayhem, with <strong>dozens of unique weapons</strong> to obliterate your opponents, on an everchanging battlefield with <strong>destructible terrain.</strong>\u00a0Manage your arsenal and unleash <strong>epic and game-changing combos</strong>, online and offline, solo or with friends, and become the greatest in the galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strategy and Tactics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Galaxy Tactics focuses on enabling <strong>effective strategic planning</strong> for each individual player as well as cooperation between teammates. Effectively utilizing your <strong>expansive arsenal</strong> and managing your <strong>energy and jetpack fuel</strong> are critical in your success on the destructible battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/Steam_Strategy.gif?t=1745227122\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The wide variety of <strong>offensive weapons</strong>, <strong>defensive tools</strong> and <strong>utility items</strong> is the heart of Galaxy Tactics. With dozens to unlock, upgrade and strategically put to use, matches are sure to always be fun and exciting. And coupled with the <strong>limitless possible interactions</strong> between weapons, unpredictable outcomes are sure to be expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/Steam_Weapons_Scroll.gif?t=1745227122\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rangers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Head to battle as one of the galaxy\u2019s elite rangers! With every ranger having a <strong>unique ability</strong>, you get the opportunity to customize and adjust your playstyle and strategy. Gain XP and level up your rangers to <strong>unlock new weapons, stat upgrade points, chromas and more</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/Steam_Rangers_Scroll.gif?t=1745227122\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From windy deserts to acidic oceans and asteroid rings, you will have to adapt to an <strong>ever-changing battlefield</strong> thanks to the <strong>destructible terrain</strong>, ensuring each and every game is completely unique. Take cover, trap opponents, and use the terrain to your advantage across a multitude of maps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/Steam_Maps.gif?t=1745227122\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re feeling competitive or just want to relax and have fun, Galaxy Tactics has you covered with the various game modes, for a great experience at any skill level, both online and offline.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quick Game</strong> \u2013 No-stakes online either solo or co-op with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ranked</strong> \u2013 Competitive online with ranks from Silver to Master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tournaments</strong> \u2013 Monthly online regional competitions with trophy rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Campaigns\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Singleplayer storylines across the Starhaven galaxy (this feature is in development and not available in Early Access)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skirmish</strong> \u2013 Offline with bots, with adjustable difficulty and mutators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Practice</strong> \u2013 Weapons testing and training without limits</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/Steam_Game_Modes.gif?t=1745227122\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574210?t=1745227122","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/889f4e4f38cc789f13fc13ad607e03b1fd45dffc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745227122","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/cd561f98daafa065267809445c0c0227d0397723/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745227122","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/cd561f98daafa065267809445c0c0227d0397723/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745227122","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/Join_Discord.jpg?t=1745227122\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/Steam_Intro.gif?t=1745227122\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph